From: LIVI OS maintainers <livi-os@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Use a black background for the appliance boot splash

Keep the framebuffer outside the supplied artwork black.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [appliance branding]
Signed-off-by: LIVI OS maintainers <livi-os@localhost>
---
 psplash-colors.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/psplash-colors.h b/psplash-colors.h
--- a/psplash-colors.h
+++ b/psplash-colors.h
@@ -15,2 +15,2 @@
 /* This is the overall background color */
-#define PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xec,0xec,0xe1
+#define PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0x00,0x00,0x00
